you may start to see things change.

00:00:58.390 --> 00:01:02.020
One interesting thing is if you look at predicted,
which is betting markets, DeSantis is now

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:05.930
in the lead as who is expected to get the
2024 Republican nomination nomination based

00:01:05.930 --> 00:01:06.930
on the betting numbers.

00:01:06.930 --> 00:01:10.170
If those numbers continue to go against Trump's
favor, you might see an acceleration.

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:13.650
But right now, nobody's really abandoned Trump.

00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:14.830
They're just giving themselves other options.

00:01:14.830 --> 00:01:15.960
